  "label": "Family Dynamics",
  "description": "The complex relationships and interactions within a family unit, including in-laws, ex-partners, and their respective families. The meme references a specific type of family dynamic involving an ex-partner and their mother, which can be fraught with tension, especially if there is a history of conflict or if the relationship is complicated by the presence of a new partner or child. Understanding this context is necessary to interpret the humor and emotional weight of the meme.",
